      "text": "Key rules (StrategyExecutor.java)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Key rules (StrategyExecutor.java)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "aX",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "legend2-body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1140,
      "y": 220,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 380,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 234,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 696274789,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793368078344,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Phases always run in fixed YAML\n  order — no conditional routing\n  (no \"if X go to phase Y\")\n\n• preflightAndStart validates every\n  tool + agent reference BEFORE any\n  DB write or LLM call (fail fast)\n\n• No automatic retries — a failed\n  step aborts the whole run\n  (StepFailedException → FAILED)\n\n• Each agent has a maxToolRounds\n  budget; exceeding it throws\n  (loop guard, not branching)\n\n• If an agent reports a bad/zero\n  price, the engine deterministically\n  repairs it via StockService before\n  persisting (repairPriceAtEvaluation-\n  Time)\n\n• EvaluationService runs separately\n  from execution — fully algorithmic,\n  computes % gain on past\n  recommendations against real\n  market prices",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Phases always run in fixed YAML\n  order — no conditional routing\n  (no \"if X go to phase Y\")\n\n• preflightAndStart validates every\n  tool + agent reference BEFORE any\n  DB write or LLM call (fail fast)\n\n• No automatic retries — a failed\n  step aborts the whole run\n  (StepFailedException → FAILED)\n\n• Each agent has a maxToolRounds\n  budget; exceeding it throws\n  (loop guard, not branching)\n\n• If an agent reports a bad/zero\n  price, the engine deterministically\n  repairs it via StockService before\n  persisting (repairPriceAtEvaluation-\n  Time)\n\n• EvaluationService runs separately\n  from execution — fully algorithmic,\n  computes % gain on past\n  recommendations against real\n  market prices",
      "lineHeight": 1.4,
      "index": "aY",
      "autoResize": true
    },
